; Zero units at cost leave no lot, so a later sale of the commodity opens a
; short lot rather than reducing a lot of zero units.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "zero"
  Assets:Stock  0 HOOL {5 USD}
  Assets:Cash   0 USD

2020-01-03 * "sell short"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {5 USD}
  Assets:Cash   5 USD

2020-01-04 balance Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL
